<title>POLAND: PPABANK FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>PPABANK FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.89 vs    0.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.37 vs    0.80</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  3.43 vs    2.97</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 4.85 vs    3.67</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Pierwszy</p>
<p>Polsko-Amerykanski Bank SA.</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.90 vs    0.62</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.91 vs    1.58</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  7.82 vs    5.64</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	11.16 vs    7.52</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
